From 5da9e04f7812d6a28d4e77adfff0f0c4bc6ff60e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joethedev5 <deepsbx1@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:24:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 44/45] Recover the AMCC RORGN lockdown and PV CTRR path

Fill in rorgn_contains, rorgn_stash_range, rorgn_lockdown,
rorgn_validate_core, lock_mmu, pv_ctrr_map_reg_base and pv_ctrr_init
from the reference image, and add the AMCC PV CTRR header with the
recovered register offsets and control bits.

Authored-By: joethedev5 <joeshmo@nunya.com>
